# The build context is only ever asked for the manifests, the two tsconfigs and
# `src` — every `COPY` above names what it wants. This file is what keeps the
# rest from being uploaded to the daemon first and then ignored, and what stops a
# stray `.env` or a local `dist/` from being in the context at all.
.git
.github
.claude
.scratch
.tmp
node_modules
dist
build
coverage
infra
docs
test
*.md
.env
.env.*
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
